 for normal motor neuron development (By similarity). (Microbial infection) Critical host factor required for infection by human coronaviruses SARS-CoV-2, HCoV-OC43, HCoV-NL63, and HCoV-229E, as well as all flaviviruses tested such as Zika virus and Yellow fever virus (PubMed:33338421, PubMed:33382968). Required post-entry of the virus to facilitate the ER membrane remodeling necessary to form replication organelles (PubMed:33382968)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}